Pherb - Speech Processing Orchestrator

PHP-based transcription orchestrator that coordinates whisper.cpp,
pyannote speaker diarization, and wav2vec2 alignment services via
NATS JetStream. Produces speaker-attributed transcripts in JSON,
SRT, and VTT formats.

This meta-port installs all Pherb components:

- pherb-api: REST API backend (Apache + mod_php)
- pherb-consumer: NATS JetStream consumer daemon

For individual component installation, install the specific packages.
